{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41954","headline":"石棊局献时宰 · 李中","name":"石棊局献时宰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得从岳叟诚堪重，却献臯夔事更宜。\n公退啓枰书院静，日斜收子竹阴移。\n适情岂待樵柯烂，罢局还应屐齿隳。\n预想幽窗风雨夜，一灯闲照覆图时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}